  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td height=3D"21"><font face=3D"Calibri">a) Entropy using the frequency=
 table of
      one attribute:</font></td>
    <td height=3D"21" width=3D"50"></td>
    <td height=3D"21" width=3D"100"></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td height=3D"21">
