    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td height=3D"21">
      <i>Step 3</i><font face=3D"Calibri">: Choose attribute with the large=
st
      information gain as the decision node, divide the dataset by its bran=
ches
      and repeat the same process on every branch.</font></td>
    <td height=3D"21" width=3D"50">
    </td>
    <td height=3D"21" width=3D"100">
    </td>
  </tr>
